GeoLens Mini publisher adaptations

Selector maps and PREPARE_ONLY / Bilibili login recovery flow adapted from everyone-geo-ref/apps/browser-assistant/src/adapters (local reference).
Upload-before-fill and creator selectors adapted from social-auto-upload/uploader/{douyin_uploader,tencent_uploader,ks_uploader,xiaohongshu_uploader,bilibili_uploader}; rich-text selectors from omnipost/uploader/zhihu_uploader; DOM/media and Bilibili tags/cover patterns from auto-publish/extension/content/adapters. Node port excludes all upstream final-submit and anti-detection logic.


